    "Català: basat en distilroberta-base-ca-v2 del Projecte Aina (Apache 2.0), entrenat amb transcripcions CC0 i Common Voice. Basc: basat en BERnaT-medium d'HiTZ (Apache 2.0), entrenat amb ParlaMint (CC BY 4.0), Common Voice i subtítols d'Open Data Euskadi (CC BY 4.0).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Catalan: based on distilroberta-base-ca-v2 from Projecte Aina (Apache 2.0), trained on CC0 transcripts and Common Voice. Basque: based on HiTZ's BERnaT-medium (Apache 2.0), trained on ParlaMint (CC BY 4.0), Common Voice and Open Data Euskadi subtitles (CC BY 4.0)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
